# Test wallet for the x402 Step 2 Kotlin CLI — Base Sepolia testnet only.
#
# Same rules as Step 1:
#   - 64 hex chars, with or without 0x prefix
#   - Generate fresh, never reuse a key that has held real funds
#   - Fund with Base Sepolia USDC: https://faucet.circle.com
#
# You can reuse the address from step1-node — it already has USDC.
# Just copy step1-node/.env to step2-kotlin-cli/.env (or set PRIVATE_KEY env var).

PRIVATE_KEY=0xReplaceWith64HexCharsNeverCommitThisFile
